  "summary_en": "Cyber Security NSW one-page do/don't guidance for NSW Government staff using public generative AI tools such as ChatGPT, Gemini and Midjourney. It stresses verifying outputs, not entering sensitive data, not letting AI make government decisions, and following internal policies and IT security advice.",
